    "description": "三列特性卡片，适合介绍产品能力。",
    "html": "<section class='hb-features'><h2 class='hb-sec-title'>为什么选择我们</h2><div class='hb-feature-grid'><article class='hb-feature-card'><div class='hb-feature-icon'>⚡</div><h3>极速生成</h3><p>几分钟完成从需求到可运行网站的完整链路。</p></article><article class='hb-feature-card'><div class='hb-feature-icon'>🎯</div><h3>像素级还原</h3><p>结构化规划与自动校验，保证页面质量稳定。</p></article><article class='hb-feature-card'><div class='hb-feature-icon'>🧩</div><h3>组件化编辑</h3><p>点选页面元素即可修改，无需手写代码。</p></article></div></section>",
    "css": ".hb-features{padding:72px 24px;max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto}.hb-sec-title{text-align:center;font-size:clamp(24px,3.2vw,36px);font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin:0 0 40px}.hb-feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:20px}.hb-feature-card{padding:28px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,.08);transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s}.hb-feature-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(15,23,42,.09)}.hb-feature-icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px;background:rgba(99,102,241,.12);margin-bottom:16px}.hb-feature-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;color:#0f172a}.hb-feature-card p{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#64748b}",
    "js": ""
  },
  {
