    "html": "<footer class='hb-footer'><div class='hb-footer-inner'><div class='hb-footer-brand'><strong>Brand</strong><p>让每个人都能轻松拥有自己的网站。</p></div><div class='hb-footer-cols'><div><h4>产品</h4><a href='#'>功能</a><a href='#'>价格</a></div><div><h4>资源</h4><a href='#'>文档</a><a href='#'>教程</a></div><div><h4>公司</h4><a href='#'>关于</a><a href='#'>联系</a></div></div></div><div class='hb-footer-bottom'>© 2026 Brand. All rights reserved.</div></footer>",
